==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print of this card was available from March 27 to April 30, 2025 as part of the "Poké Gold (paid) ×115 + Promo Card (Mewtwo ex)" {{TCGP|shop}} bundle, which could be purchased using real-world currency.

