==Trivia==
This card's immersive illustration features {{p|Mewtwo}} breaking out of captivity from a laboratory; this laboratory bears a strong resemblance to an area in the basement of the {{ka|Pokémon Mansion}}, as depicted in {{LGPE}}. {{p|Mew}} can briefly be seen in the glass of the broken enclosure.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Mewtwo}}.
*'''Psychic Sphere''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Latias Half Deck|Latias|14}} from the {{TCG|XY Trainer Kit: Latias & Latios}}.
*'''Psydrive''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Mewtwo-EX|54}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.

